1
00:00:13,743 --> 00:00:15,536
Naoya.

2
00:00:16,829 --> 00:00:19,457
Hoshizaki!
What will you do to him?

3
00:00:20,124 --> 00:00:22,084
What's going on?

4
00:00:22,084 --> 00:00:26,630
Hoshizaki tied unconscious Mukai on a bed
with tape and locked the door.

5
00:00:28,966 --> 00:00:31,802
Let's do this, Naoya.

6
00:00:31,802 --> 00:00:34,013
She's going to do something immoral!

7
00:00:37,475 --> 00:00:40,936
Naoya, you're so warm.

8
00:00:43,022 --> 00:00:46,025
It's definitely in already!

9
00:00:46,025 --> 00:00:48,986
Are you ready to fall in
fall in love with me?

10
00:00:48,986 --> 00:00:53,157
I wanna let you know when
I have a crush on you! You!

11
00:00:55,117 --> 00:00:58,079
A throbbing development
is a maiden's desire!

12
00:00:58,079 --> 00:00:59,330
Is admiration not enough?

13
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:01,123
It is not exciting enough!

14
00:01:01,123 --> 00:01:04,001
A beam of love that heals the world

15
00:01:04,001 --> 00:01:06,962
I want to be loved, I want to be in love

16
00:01:06,962 --> 00:01:08,380
Such ambiguous impulse

17
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,715
I miss you! How about you?

18
00:01:09,715 --> 00:01:12,259
Notice my gaze

19
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:15,930
I see the future where I am with you

20
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:17,932
My dream is getting bigger

21
00:01:17,932 --> 00:01:21,227
The feelings I have been hiding
just popped out

22
00:01:21,227 --> 00:01:24,438
This heart of mine becomes noisy
when it is just the two of us

23
00:01:24,438 --> 00:01:29,860
Although you won't notice
since you are so dense

24
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:36,075
I know that I am not the one
you are looking at

25
00:01:36,075 --> 00:01:39,286
Still, I cannot stop wishing for

26
00:01:39,286 --> 00:01:42,873
a love story with you

27
00:01:43,499 --> 00:01:46,710
I want to fall in love dramatically

28
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:49,588
I want to love you romantically

29
00:01:49,588 --> 00:01:55,511
I want you to take me for real
and fall in love with you

30
00:01:55,511 --> 00:01:58,556
Choose me in a roundabout way

31
00:01:58,556 --> 00:02:01,684
Make me laugh with a happy ending

32
00:02:01,684 --> 00:02:04,687
There is a view I want to see with you

33
00:02:04,687 --> 00:02:07,481
I would rather be next to you

34
00:02:07,481 --> 00:02:09,358
Just keep that in mind

35
00:02:18,033 --> 00:02:19,451
You don't have a key?

36
00:02:19,451 --> 00:02:21,453
We might have a spare somewhere.

37
00:02:21,453 --> 00:02:22,705
Let's find it!

38
00:02:23,289 --> 00:02:24,415
Yeah!

39
00:02:31,755 --> 00:02:33,757
You're awake?

40
00:02:37,595 --> 00:02:39,054
You kidnapped me again?!

41
00:02:39,471 --> 00:02:41,724
It's legal if a beauty does it.

42
00:02:41,724 --> 00:02:43,517
No way that's true!

43
00:02:43,517 --> 00:02:45,477
Why are you doing this again?

44
00:02:45,477 --> 00:02:48,856
Huh! That's obvious!

45
00:02:50,608 --> 00:02:56,197
It's because you were trying to kiss Saki.

46
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:01,869
Don't kidnap someone with
an awful reason like that!

47
00:03:01,869 --> 00:03:03,537
It's enough reason for me!

48
00:03:03,537 --> 00:03:05,873
I'm dating her,
so it's normal to kiss her.

49
00:03:05,873 --> 00:03:06,790
You can't!

50
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:11,045
If you kiss her, then Saki's gonna
become even more important to you.

51
00:03:11,045 --> 00:03:14,131
And it's gonna be hard to
make you break up with her.

52
00:03:14,131 --> 00:03:16,258
I don't want three-timing.

53
00:03:16,258 --> 00:03:18,427
Why should you care?

54
00:03:18,427 --> 00:03:20,095
Shut up!

55
00:03:20,095 --> 00:03:22,473
If you want to kiss someone that badly,

56
00:03:23,432 --> 00:03:26,769
kiss me and fall on me more!

57
00:03:35,527 --> 00:03:36,403
How's that?

58
00:03:36,403 --> 00:03:37,696
Kiss on the cheek?

59
00:03:37,696 --> 00:03:41,075
You told me that
I can't kiss you on the lips.

60
00:03:41,075 --> 00:03:43,539
Because that counts as something lewd.

61
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:45,246
So you remember that?

62
00:03:45,573 --> 00:03:47,250
Of course, since it's our promise.

63
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:49,629
I should have banned kidnapping as well.

64
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:53,750
But doing something like this
won't make me fall for you at all.

65
00:03:54,463 --> 00:03:58,801
Even though kissing your cheek
is making my heart throbbing...

66
00:03:58,801 --> 00:04:00,552
Then...!

67
00:04:02,513 --> 00:04:05,224
On my neck?!

68
00:04:06,016 --> 00:04:07,685
You're getting flustered.

69
00:04:17,861 --> 00:04:20,072
Alright.

70
00:04:21,782 --> 00:04:23,033
Don't tell me...

71
00:04:26,996 --> 00:04:28,831
This is bad!

72
00:04:29,581 --> 00:04:32,126
If she does more than this...

73
00:04:43,010 --> 00:04:45,889
This is embarrassing.

74
00:04:46,181 --> 00:04:47,599
Then don't do it!

75
00:04:47,599 --> 00:04:49,101
Shut up!

76
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,649
How was it?

77
00:04:51,650 --> 00:04:54,063
That made you fall for me a bit, right?

78
00:04:54,064 --> 00:04:55,816
You said that it'd be bad, right?

79
00:04:55,816 --> 00:04:57,568
Well...

80
00:05:00,446 --> 00:05:05,659
Wait, I was able to calm down
after seeing you get embarrassed.

81
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,164
Then I'll do more!

82
00:05:10,164 --> 00:05:12,374
I'll never let you leave this place!

83
00:05:12,374 --> 00:05:13,709
You should stop!

84
00:05:13,709 --> 00:05:15,169
Shut up!

85
00:05:15,169 --> 00:05:17,129
I won't allow it!

86
00:05:17,796 --> 00:05:22,343
I don't want you to kiss any girl than me!

87
00:05:22,926 --> 00:05:24,511
Mirika...

88
00:05:28,807 --> 00:05:30,851
Hoshizaki...

89
00:05:32,561 --> 00:05:34,188
Got it?

90
00:05:34,188 --> 00:05:36,315
Well...

91
00:05:36,690 --> 00:05:38,317
I don't care about that!

92
00:05:38,317 --> 00:05:40,194
Damn you!

93
00:05:40,194 --> 00:05:42,237
I found the key!

94
00:05:42,237 --> 00:05:43,364
Sakisaki!

95
00:05:45,741 --> 00:05:49,078
Death to the lewd twintail!

96
00:05:52,664 --> 00:05:53,999
She ran away.

97
00:05:59,713 --> 00:06:02,841
I won't give up.

98
00:06:04,635 --> 00:06:07,012
Thank goodness, the pants are still there.

99
00:06:10,766 --> 00:06:12,601
She really made me angry.

100
00:06:12,601 --> 00:06:16,021
That bastard, Mirika.
I can't let my guard down.

101
00:06:16,021 --> 00:06:17,231
Saki.

102
00:06:19,608 --> 00:06:22,194
I'm looking forward to the barbecue!

103
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:24,321
I'm going to start the fire.

104
00:06:24,321 --> 00:06:26,156
I'll succeed this time.

105
00:06:26,156 --> 00:06:29,034
Shino, we have to come up
with the next plan.

106
00:06:29,034 --> 00:06:32,162
We have to stop Naoya and Saki
from kissing, no matter what.

107
00:06:32,162 --> 00:06:34,164
Okay.

108
00:06:34,164 --> 00:06:36,500
Is there something that can we do?

109
00:06:38,877 --> 00:06:42,840
Were you just planning on waiting
while Naoya and Saki went to kiss?

110
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:48,178
I don't want you to kiss any girl than me!

111
00:06:50,556 --> 00:06:54,935
If only I could be as shameless as you...

112
00:06:54,935 --> 00:06:56,520
You want a fight?

113
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:59,356
I didn't mean it in that way.

114
00:06:59,356 --> 00:07:03,277
So, do you have an idea
to prevent them from kissing?

115
00:07:03,277 --> 00:07:04,027
Huh?

116
00:07:04,027 --> 00:07:06,238
You're the top student in our year, right?

117
00:07:08,157 --> 00:07:11,243
Have them eat a lot of garlic, maybe?

118
00:07:11,243 --> 00:07:13,328
You're a genius!

119
00:07:20,002 --> 00:07:21,003
Hey...

120
00:07:21,712 --> 00:07:27,926
If Sakisaki was your friend,
would you still get in her way?

121
00:07:29,678 --> 00:07:31,430
Never mind, of course you would.

122
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,432
You're definitely picking a fight with me.

123
00:07:33,432 --> 00:07:35,184
I would, though!

124
00:07:35,684 --> 00:07:38,770
I don't care for anything other than
what's most important to me.

125
00:07:38,770 --> 00:07:40,772
In other words, anything other than Naoya.

126
00:07:40,772 --> 00:07:44,234
That's not how things work normally.

127
00:07:44,234 --> 00:07:46,570
You're such a bothersome woman.

128
00:07:47,154 --> 00:07:48,697
It's done!

129
00:07:49,114 --> 00:07:50,407
Hey!

130
00:07:51,617 --> 00:07:54,912
I got some delicious food here for you,
as an apology for before.

131
00:07:54,912 --> 00:07:56,038
That looks good.

132
00:07:56,038 --> 00:07:58,916
That food has a ton of garlic in it.

133
00:07:58,916 --> 00:08:00,542
It really smells.

134
00:08:00,542 --> 00:08:02,961
Damn you, Mirika!

135
00:08:02,961 --> 00:08:06,298
Whatever! Open wide, Naoya!
Just eat it!

136
00:08:06,757 --> 00:08:08,258
Cut it out!

137
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:18,689
If only I was like Hoshizaki,
who had the courage and determination

138
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:23,190
to chase after love, without caring...

139
00:08:26,818 --> 00:08:28,153
Mukai.

140
00:08:28,153 --> 00:08:28,946
Did you call me?

141
00:08:28,946 --> 00:08:29,988
Eh?!

142
00:08:29,988 --> 00:08:33,283
Mukai? What are you doing here?

143
00:08:33,283 --> 00:08:35,994
I thought you looked a bit down.

144
00:08:37,996 --> 00:08:41,792
And you called me just now, right?
Did you need something?

145
00:08:41,792 --> 00:08:43,210
That's where you're asking me?

146
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:44,878
I clearly heard you calling me.

147
00:08:44,878 --> 00:08:46,380
It was your imagination!

148
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:47,923
Is that so?

149
00:08:47,923 --> 00:08:48,715
Yes!

150
00:08:49,925 --> 00:08:53,929
That's the ribbon I gave you
back in middle school, right?

151
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:58,725
So you've been using it all this time,
that makes me happy.

152
00:08:58,725 --> 00:09:02,854
I just happened to keep it
with me for long.

153
00:09:04,273 --> 00:09:08,360
You've always looked after Saki
since back then.

154
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:11,822
And you even let us use your villa
for Saki's sake.

155
00:09:11,822 --> 00:09:13,949
You're really a nice person.

156
00:09:13,949 --> 00:09:17,619
What's this, all of a sudden?

157
00:09:17,619 --> 00:09:19,788
I always thought so.

158
00:09:20,247 --> 00:09:24,251
That's why I also care about you.

159
00:09:24,585 --> 00:09:27,963
If you're worrying about something,
I'll be your help.

160
00:09:28,964 --> 00:09:30,465
Mukai...

161
00:09:30,465 --> 00:09:34,136
You could've gone to
a better high school,

162
00:09:34,136 --> 00:09:37,723
but you chose to stay
by Saki's side, right?

163
00:09:40,517 --> 00:09:43,020
The reason I chose
the same school as Sakisaki

164
00:09:43,395 --> 00:09:45,981
was to stay close to you.

165
00:09:47,024 --> 00:09:50,986
And the reason I let you use the villa

166
00:09:50,986 --> 00:09:54,615
was because I thought that could
increase my chances with you.

167
00:09:56,825 --> 00:10:00,203
I hate how pathetic I am.

168
00:10:04,416 --> 00:10:08,211
Sorry, I lied.

169
00:10:09,713 --> 00:10:14,468
I won't be able to move forward
if I can't muster up the courage.

170
00:10:16,261 --> 00:10:18,889
The truth about this ribbon is...!

171
00:10:22,225 --> 00:10:23,310
The ribbon!

172
00:10:26,063 --> 00:10:27,481
Shino!

173
00:10:28,023 --> 00:10:30,484
It's dangerous!
The tide is going to be high soon!

174
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,527
No!

175
00:10:36,031 --> 00:10:38,867
That ribbon is important to me!

176
00:10:39,534 --> 00:10:40,619
Watch out!

177
00:10:48,251 --> 00:10:50,462
Shino!

178
00:11:06,770 --> 00:11:09,481
I'm glad we managed to land.

179
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,983
Thank you.

180
00:11:13,777 --> 00:11:16,196
Let's return back to everyone.

181
00:11:18,365 --> 00:11:19,366
Wait...

182
00:11:20,867 --> 00:11:22,035
What?

183
00:11:26,373 --> 00:11:28,583
A desert island?!

184
00:11:28,583 --> 00:11:29,835
What?!

185
00:11:30,127 --> 00:11:33,296
I'm alone with Mukai on a desert island?

186
00:11:34,172 --> 00:11:37,259
In a place like this...

187
00:11:37,634 --> 00:11:42,222
It might be the one and only big chance
that I can get to get closer to Mukai.

188
00:11:42,222 --> 00:11:48,103
And if we never get back, we could
end up living here together forever.

189
00:11:50,355 --> 00:11:52,107
Let's make a baseball team.

190
00:11:53,108 --> 00:11:55,152
Can I really give birth to that many?

191
00:11:55,152 --> 00:11:57,779
We can see the main island.

192
00:11:57,779 --> 00:11:59,781
It doesn't seem too far.

193
00:11:59,781 --> 00:12:03,493
Of course it is!
We didn't swim too long, after all.

194
00:12:03,994 --> 00:12:08,123
But it's too dangerous
to swim back in the dark.

195
00:12:08,123 --> 00:12:10,751
We'll have to spend the night here.

196
00:12:10,751 --> 00:12:12,836
Uh, yeah.

197
00:12:13,253 --> 00:12:14,755
By the way, what about the ribbon?

198
00:12:14,755 --> 00:12:15,672
Huh?

199
00:12:16,089 --> 00:12:20,677
Yeah, I managed to get it thanks to you.

200
00:12:20,677 --> 00:12:22,262
That's good to hear.

201
00:12:23,638 --> 00:12:24,973
I'm sorry.

202
00:12:24,973 --> 00:12:26,099
Huh?

203
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:28,920
This all happened because
I jumped into the sea.

204
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:32,397
Sakisaki and the others must be worried.

205
00:12:32,397 --> 00:12:35,066
Even though we're on vacation here...

206
00:12:36,693 --> 00:12:37,694
Wait.

207
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:41,261
Rather, the reason we got here

208
00:12:41,263 --> 00:12:44,993
is because I took a wrong turn
while I swam with you in my arms!

209
00:12:45,285 --> 00:12:46,536
Forgive me!

210
00:12:46,536 --> 00:12:47,204
Hey!

211
00:12:47,204 --> 00:12:49,706
It's not your fault.

212
00:12:49,706 --> 00:12:50,791
Thanks.

213
00:12:50,791 --> 00:12:53,502
Then, let's just say we're both to blame
and leave it at that.

214
00:12:53,502 --> 00:12:54,669
Huh?!

215
00:12:55,045 --> 00:13:00,634
I'm happy that you treasure the ribbon,
to the point of jumping into the sea.

216
00:13:01,551 --> 00:13:03,094
That's...

217
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:07,557
Once we get back tomorrow,
let's apologize to everyone.

218
00:13:07,557 --> 00:13:09,059
Yeah.

219
00:13:09,059 --> 00:13:14,356
Also, it's not every day we get on
a desert island, let's enjoy ourselves.

220
00:13:14,356 --> 00:13:16,149
It's rare for people
to come to this place.

221
00:13:16,149 --> 00:13:19,277
Huh? But that would...

222
00:13:19,277 --> 00:13:22,697
Why do you even care so much
about that ribbon?

223
00:13:22,697 --> 00:13:24,282
Let's enjoy ourselves!

224
00:13:26,409 --> 00:13:29,371
The first thing to do on a desert island
is to get a source of water.

225
00:13:29,371 --> 00:13:31,498
There's a palm tree right here.

226
00:13:31,498 --> 00:13:33,041
I'll go grab some.

227
00:13:33,583 --> 00:13:35,168
Are you sure?

228
00:13:35,168 --> 00:13:37,712
I can do at least this much.

229
00:13:48,431 --> 00:13:50,934
I'm sorry!

230
00:13:50,934 --> 00:13:52,853
Me too.

231
00:13:52,853 --> 00:13:55,689
Look, there's one fell down.

232
00:13:59,943 --> 00:14:01,903
No!

233
00:14:01,903 --> 00:14:04,239
I only saw it for a second!

234
00:14:09,244 --> 00:14:14,666
Why does this kind of thing always happen
when I'm with you?

235
00:14:14,666 --> 00:14:15,625
Shino?

236
00:14:15,625 --> 00:14:18,461
Usually, I'm a very dependable girl,
you know!

237
00:14:18,461 --> 00:14:19,671
I know about that!

238
00:14:19,671 --> 00:14:22,549
But that side of you is also cute!

239
00:14:22,549 --> 00:14:24,009
Cute?

240
00:14:24,885 --> 00:14:28,471
Why do you always say that to everyone?

241
00:14:28,471 --> 00:14:30,223
I don't say it to everyone.

242
00:14:30,223 --> 00:14:33,560
Wait!

243
00:14:34,436 --> 00:14:36,730
I'm so happy.

244
00:14:41,192 --> 00:14:42,819
A snake!

245
00:14:46,448 --> 00:14:50,619
It's dangerous,
but this is also exciting, isn't it?

246
00:14:54,247 --> 00:14:55,373
Yeah.

247
00:14:56,666 --> 00:15:01,630
If only me and Mukai could be
together like this all the time...

248
00:15:03,048 --> 00:15:05,926
Let's take one letter
each from Papa's name.

249
00:15:05,926 --> 00:15:08,762
Like, Takuya and Naoko.

250
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:18,229
Sorry.

251
00:15:18,229 --> 00:15:21,608
It's fine, I don't mind it.

252
00:15:22,734 --> 00:15:24,110
Are you cold?

253
00:15:24,110 --> 00:15:27,197
I see, your swimsuit is still wet.

254
00:15:27,197 --> 00:15:28,907
I'm fine.

255
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:31,034
Alright!

256
00:15:31,034 --> 00:15:32,493
Took it off, for now!

257
00:15:32,494 --> 00:15:33,370
What?!

258
00:15:33,703 --> 00:15:36,706
Your body temperature will go down
if you keep wearing it!

259
00:15:36,706 --> 00:15:37,707
But...

260
00:15:37,707 --> 00:15:40,335
Don't worry, I won't look at you!

261
00:15:40,335 --> 00:15:41,586
And I'll make a fire!

262
00:15:42,128 --> 00:15:44,172
If you want, I could do it first.

263
00:15:44,172 --> 00:15:46,049
I get it!

264
00:15:47,509 --> 00:15:51,012
Get some sticks,
and use frictional heat to...

265
00:15:51,388 --> 00:15:54,975
Getting naked right beside Mukai.

266
00:15:55,433 --> 00:15:58,269
It's very embarrassing, but...

267
00:15:59,729 --> 00:16:02,774
I don't want the time
I spend alone with him

268
00:16:03,733 --> 00:16:06,820
to end without me doing anything.

269
